252 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 212 0 R/T(I'm Bruna, mother of three, wife, dog mom and nature lover. After a difficult postpartum following the birth of my third child, I sought out the support I needed to find my way through it. That experience changed how I see postpartum care, and it's why Cora exists: so other mothers don't have to navigate this season alone.)/E(I'm Bruna, mother of three, wife, dog mom and nature lover. After a difficult postpartum following the birth of my third child, I sought out the support I needed to find my way through it. That experience changed how I see postpartum care, and it's why Cora exists: so other mothers don't have to navigate this season alone.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

